python	docker.io/library/python:3.14.7-slim@sha256:7bf6c3111fe094f8ee1a1cbcdc63c4cfb345b0e3df42d5aa9a90b3b4b022ab6d	python 3.14.7, UCD 16.0.0	The Python dialect: `re`, `re.split` and `re.sub`

