# structural rather than a raise waiting to happen.** Go 1.25.14 carries
# Unicode 15.0.0 where tools/unicode/UCD_VERSION is 17.0.0 - two releases,
# against CPython's one and node's none. Go raises the version it vendors on
# its own schedule and a newer Go is the only way to move it, so a
# differential that asks about `\p{...}` or about case folding is asking a
