# measuring the Consortium and reporting it as a defect here.
go	docker.io/library/golang@sha256:2c4c60ef415fbfa5e90300722293bef36c5e63fae17570ce18f580af933dbd73	go1.25.14, Unicode 15.0.0	The RE2 dialect: `regexp`, its split and its replacement template

